# Docker Commands — APACE_JATENG

Run these from the project root (`/home/skj/Documents/webapp/APACE_JATENG`).

## Two compose files
| File                     | Purpose                                        |
|--------------------------|------------------------------------------------|
| `docker-compose.dev.yml` | Dev: hot reload, run on localhost             |
| `docker-compose.yml`     | Prod: built frontend (nginx) at https://jateng.apace-ai.com/ |

## DEV (hot reload — localhost)
```bash
docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d --build
docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml down
docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml logs -f backend
docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml logs -f frontend
```

## PROD (built + nginx)
```bash
docker compose up -d --build   # uses docker-compose.yml by default
docker compose down
docker compose logs -f frontend
```

## One-liner: down → build → up (prod)
```bash
docker compose down && docker compose up -d --build
```

## Useful checks
```bash
docker compose ps              # status of all services
docker compose logs -f backend
docker compose logs -f frontend
docker compose logs -f db
```

## Ports
| Service   | Host port |
|-----------|-----------|
| frontend  | 8003      |
| backend   | 8004      |
| db        | 5436      |

## Cloudflare tunnel
```bash
sudo systemctl restart cloudflared
sudo systemctl status cloudflared
```